:: Bog Cult Salem Temple
You begin to talk about life at the wolf street temple, much to Salem's utter shock.
<br><br>
“Eh-wait, you're one of… them?” <<He>> gasps out, covering <<his>> mouth. <<His>> demeanour turns a bit sour as <<he>> bites down on <<his>> lip, edging away from you.
<br><br>
<<if $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
    “What? What were you expecting?” You scoff, rolling your eyes as you grab <<his>> arm to keep <<him>> from inching away, “I'm not going to bite your head off or anything, quit being a wuss.”
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "meek">>
    “I-I wasn't sure how to tell you!” you try to comfort <<him>>, heart breaking when <<he>> flinches away from you, “You told me you weren't going to hurt me, so why can't you trust that I won't, too?”
<<else>> 
    “Hey, that's not fair” you frown, “You said the fellowship wasn't bad, despite how it could come across. Why can't you give me the benefit of the doubt, huh?”
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> looks at you through <<his>> hair, <<his>> eyes look watery< “No, no, y-you're right. I'm sorry. I was just really excited to have someone who was-”
<br><br>
<<He>> stops himself abruptly, “N-Nevermind.”
<br><br>
<<salemroomicon>><<link [[Next|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><<set $churchsalemtold to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Bog Cult Salem Backstory
Salem hums at your question, a small laugh leaving <<him>>.
<br><br>
"H-How did I join?" <<He>> parrots, and you nod at <<him>>, "I was born into this. My father's the premiere elder, and I've been studying to follow in his footsteps. My life has always been this way, and I'm quite content with it.”
<br><br>
<<His>> expression is serene at the topic, if not a little melancholic.
<br><br>
“A-Anyway, there's something I'm curious about, too.” <<His>> fingers interlace with each other as <<he>> fidgets.
<br><br>
“You kept coming back to the bog, despite everything you saw…” <<he>> starts, staring at <<his>> hands, “Why? Were you not afraid?”
<br><br>
<<link [[Answer|Bog Cult Salem Answer]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Decline to say|Bog Cult Salem Decline]]>><</link>>

:: Bog Cult Salem Answer
<<if $willpower gte ($willpowermax * 0.6)>>
    <<if $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
        “I don't get scared” You boast with a scoff, “Unlike a certain someone, no?”
    <<elseif $speech_attitude is "meek">>
        “Ah, well…” You giggle, rubbing your neck, “I-It's difficult to be afraid when I get curious.”
    <<else>> 
       “Not scared” You say, “Just.. curious?”
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    “You're so.. Brave…” <<he>> says, running <<his>> hands through his hair, “I-I don't think I could ever leave the temple, let alone the bog itself. It's too… dangerous, out there. My father tells me I should stay here, where it's… safe.”
<<else>>
    <<if $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
        ”I don't get scared.” You cross your arms and turn away from Salem, who can't help but quietly giggle.
    <<elseif $speech_attitude is "meek">>
        “I was!” you exclaim, clutching your arms, “I-It was super scary, I thought I w-wasn't going to make it!”
    <<else>> 
        “Yeah, I was pretty scared” You say, shrugging, “But I had no other way out anyway.”
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    “I-I think it's scary out there too,” <<he>> says, idly twirling a strand of <<his>> hair, “That's why I stay in the temple. My father says that it's the safest here. You could be safe here, too…”
<</if>>
